WEBVTT

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:30.688
of belonging,

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:31.939
of getting,

00:02:31.981 --> 00:02:33.441
of being gotten.

00:02:34.692 --> 00:02:38.196
It is the crack

00:02:38.237 --> 00:02:42.909
that opens up our hearts
and reminds us to let light in.

00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:47.663
Now I own Milk Bar,

00:02:47.705 --> 00:02:49.957
this quirky American-style bakery

00:02:49.957 --> 00:02:52.084
that I'll tell you
a little bit about later.

00:02:52.084 --> 00:02:53.836
And I have found

00:02:53.878 --> 00:02:57.506
that magic is often created
by breaking some sort of rule.

00:02:58.549 --> 00:03:00.843
Like the "no sweets before dinner" rule.